# Top-level pins for the Bugsink instance venv; compiled to the hash-locked
# bugsink_requirements.txt next to this file. Regenerate after a bump with:
#   uv pip compile --generate-hashes --universal --python-version 3.13 \
#     --exclude-newer <2-weeks-ago, supply-chain cooldown> \
#     apps/observability/imbue/observability/deploy_assets/bugsink_requirements.in \
#     -o apps/observability/imbue/observability/deploy_assets/bugsink_requirements.txt
# then re-diff bugsink_conf.py against the new upstream docker.py.template.
